the company's image feels much warmer.

29
00:02:12,403 --> 00:02:13,203
Of course.

30
00:02:15,636 --> 00:02:16,136
Hey.

31
00:02:16,688 --> 00:02:20,439
So you got married to make the company
look warmer and friendlier?

32
00:02:20,439 --> 00:02:23,021
And why did it have to be Yong?

33
00:02:23,021 --> 00:02:26,719
He's ten years younger than you.
Or are you planning to...

34
00:02:26,719 --> 00:02:29,636
Has Yong spoon-fed you
when you're old?

35
00:02:32,203 --> 00:02:33,769
Is that seriously your mouth, Chom?

36
00:02:34,769 --> 00:02:36,836
I can't help but wonder.

37
00:02:42,569 --> 00:02:44,236
I chose Mr.Yong.

38
00:02:45,069 --> 00:02:47,369
Because the list Mom sent earlier

39
00:02:48,236 --> 00:02:49,869
