major projects.

42
00:02:58,923 --> 00:03:02,307
Then, how about we turn on the cameras

43
00:03:02,307 --> 00:03:05,803
so we can get to know
each other better?

44
00:03:13,069 --> 00:03:14,836
Why was it an old guy on the screen?

45
00:03:18,621 --> 00:03:19,503
Here, boss.

46
00:03:24,636 --> 00:03:27,635
Strength: Gets along with
people easily.

47
00:03:28,237 --> 00:03:33,705
Weakness: Falls for other people's
smiles a little too easily.

48
00:03:45,203 --> 00:03:46,003
Okay.

49
00:03:49,969 --> 00:03:51,216
Um, excuse me.

50
00:03:51,868 --> 00:03:52,503
This way, please.

51
00:03:58,903 --> 00:03:59,703
Useless.

52
00:04:00,769 --> 00:04:01,569
Useless.

53
00:04:06,303 --> 00:04:07,569
Why are they all so useless?

54
00:04:15,669 --> 00:04:17,303
Ten years younger.

55
00:04:19,636 --> 00:04:20,836
Good image.

56
00:04:22,769 --> 00:04:24,069
Looks easy to control.

57
00:04:30,669 --> 00:04:31,769
Hello, Mom.

58
00:04:33,069 --> 00:04:34,969
You can start looking for
a wedding date.

59
00:04:36,669 --> 00:04:37,469
Yes. Useless.

60
00:04:38,103 --> 00:04:40,036
I've found my future groom.

61
00:04:44,236 --> 00:04:45,036
Perfect.

62
00:04:53,069 --> 00:04:55,335
What's so great about Yong, anyway?

63
00:04:55,335 --> 00:04:59,385
All he ever posts are pictures
with his family and parents.

64
00:04:59,636 --> 00:05:01,214
Going to temples and making merit.

65
00:05:01,615 --> 00:05:03,610
Always doing family activities.

66
00:05:03,610 --> 00:05:05,920
He's almost too well-behaved.

67
00:05:06,036 --> 00:05:06,836
Gosh!

68
00:05:07,503 --> 00:05:10,700
It's because Yong seems
like a good person.

69
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:12,729
He's obedient.

70
00:05:12,729 --> 00:05:15,669
Easy to control, unlike you, Chom.

71
00:05:16,069 --> 00:05:16,595
Hey!

72
00:05:17,046 --> 00:05:18,469
And most importantly,

73
00:05:19,969 --> 00:05:21,892
his family's cold storage business

74
00:05:21,892 --> 00:05:25,636
is a perfect match for our company.

75
00:05:27,003 --> 00:05:31,256
There! Finally telling
the truth, Mrs. Theerachat.

76
00:05:31,808 --> 00:05:35,777
I already knew, so I went behind
the scenes and talked to Yong's family.

77
00:05:36,780 --> 00:05:38,420
It's a win-win for both sides.

78
00:05:39,469 --> 00:05:41,236
That is so typical of Mrs. Chawee.

79
00:05:41,669 --> 00:05:42,636
Do you know, Mom?

80
00:05:43,203 --> 00:05:44,469
This wedding deal

81
00:05:45,203 --> 00:05:48,203
