by 15 percent.

82
00:05:50,169 --> 00:05:50,969
Whoa.

83
00:05:51,103 --> 00:05:53,169
This isn't about choosing a husband.

84
00:05:53,436 --> 00:05:55,769
It's clearly choosing
a business partner.

85
00:05:57,471 --> 00:05:59,036
Look at the stock chart, Mom.

86
00:06:00,436 --> 00:06:03,169
Our stock has hit an all-time high.

87
00:06:04,069 --> 00:06:04,869
Impressive.

88
00:06:06,303 --> 00:06:07,769
I'll give you three seconds.

89
00:06:08,003 --> 00:06:08,803
Okay.

90
00:06:12,869 --> 00:06:14,803
I'll be done before three seconds are up.

91
00:06:16,969 --> 00:06:17,769
One.

92
00:06:19,403 --> 00:06:20,539
Two.

93
00:06:20,539 --> 00:06:21,662
Three.

94
00:06:22,063 --> 00:06:23,369
Perfect.

95
00:06:32,503 --> 00:06:33,303
Beautiful.

96
00:06:34,810 --> 00:06:35,584
Let's go.

97
00:06:36,236 --> 00:06:38,069
Let's go, Secretary Han.

98
00:06:38,803 --> 00:06:40,369
It's time for the interview.

99
00:06:40,969 --> 00:06:42,103
Understood, Boss.

100
00:06:47,303 --> 00:06:48,925
Mom.

101
00:06:48,925 --> 00:06:50,505
Is this a wedding

102
00:06:50,505 --> 00:06:53,369
or a corporate vision presentation?

103
00:06:54,869 --> 00:06:58,069
With Chat, those are basically
the same thing.

104
00:07:00,069 --> 00:07:00,869
Huh?

105
00:08:21,670 --> 00:08:24,203
It's absolutely magnificent.

106
00:08:33,016 --> 00:08:34,303
Wow.

107
00:08:35,303 --> 00:08:36,803
Let's hear a round of applause.

108
00:08:37,337 --> 00:08:38,403
So beautiful. Absolutely gorgeous.

109
00:08:39,937 --> 00:08:41,137
Hello, everyone!

110
00:08:41,303 --> 00:08:44,737
Today, I'm Ja-Ja,
and we're at a ten-billion-baht wedding.

111
00:08:45,037 --> 00:08:45,837
Ten billion!

112
00:08:46,303 --> 00:08:49,999
And here's our beautiful bride,
Mrs. Chatworachotbadin.

113
00:08:49,999 --> 00:08:52,203
The gorgeous CEO of

114
00:08:52,603 --> 00:08:53,937
Honey Grain!

115
00:08:54,316 --> 00:08:55,737
Wow!

116
00:08:55,737 --> 00:08:58,870
But today, our viewers have
a question for you, Mrs.Chat.

117
00:08:59,503 --> 00:09:01,002
Everyone wants to know...

118
00:09:01,002 --> 00:09:05,612
So what's really going
on between Mr. Yong and Mrs. Chat?

119
00:09:05,612 --> 00:09:07,837
When did the sparks start flying?
Could you tell us the story?

120
00:09:10,103 --> 00:09:14,103
Well, Mom sent me his résumé.

121
00:09:16,270 --> 00:09:17,070
His résumé?

122
00:09:17,737 --> 00:09:20,270
Oh, so your mom introduced you two?

123
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:22,437
Ah, going through the parents.

124
00:09:22,437 --> 00:09:23,903
That's right.

125
00:09:24,437 --> 00:09:27,803
So what made you decide
to get married, Mrs. Chat?

126
00:09:28,337 --> 00:09:30,837
Of course, it is because of
the balance sheet.

127
00:09:34,337 --> 00:09:37,303
After the merger, profits should grow.

128
00:09:38,837 --> 00:09:40,103
The balance sheet... profits...

129
00:09:41,737 --> 00:09:44,501
The perfect match between
the two of them.

130
00:09:44,501 --> 00:09:47,027
Okay, a perfect match.

131
00:09:47,027 --> 00:09:51,394
And the two families
fit together perfectly, too.

132
00:09:51,394 --> 00:09:54,070
So where are you two going
for your honeymoon?

133
00:09:54,270 --> 00:09:54,833
Yeah, where?

134
00:09:54,833 --> 00:09:56,702
Of course, we're going to...

135
00:09:56,702 --> 00:09:59,437
Dubai for a business trip.

136
00:10:00,803 --> 00:10:02,037
Huh? Business?

137
00:10:02,203 --> 00:10:03,202
Dubai!

138
00:10:03,202 --> 00:10:04,070
B-Business trip

139
00:10:04,203 --> 00:10:04,637
Dubai!

140
00:10:04,637 --> 00:10:07,237
You mean Dubai is
a business hub, right?

141
00:10:07,537 --> 00:10:08,337
So you'll

142
00:10:08,437 --> 00:10:11,078
combine your honeymoon
with closing business deals?

143
00:10:11,078 --> 00:10:13,529
Wow, killing two birds with one stone!

144
00:10:14,133 --> 00:10:16,133
What a trip!
How fabulous!

145
00:10:16,538 --> 00:10:17,635
So romantic!

146
00:10:17,635 --> 00:10:19,635
Absolutely fabulous.

147
00:10:19,636 --> 00:10:20,532
Could we get some
solo shots of the bride?

148
00:10:20,532 --> 00:10:22,532
Let's make them beautiful!

149
00:10:23,023 --> 00:10:24,803
Boss Chat.

150
00:10:24,803 --> 00:10:28,048
The Singaporean investor
we've been pursuing

151
00:10:28,048 --> 00:10:29,984
has confirmed their investment.

152
00:10:30,185 --> 00:10:32,237
They're also flying in next month
for a site visit.

153
00:10:37,403 --> 00:10:38,476
See?

154
00:10:39,028 --> 00:10:40,757
This wedding brings nothing

155
00:10:41,158 --> 00:10:42,557
but profit.

156
00:10:43,945 --> 00:10:45,945
So smart

157
00:10:45,946 --> 00:10:47,093
Thirachat.

158
00:10:50,503 --> 00:10:52,081
Of course, we're going to...

159
00:10:52,081 --> 00:10:54,703
Dubai for a business trip.

160
00:10:55,137 --> 00:10:55,937
Dubai!

161
00:10:56,703 --> 00:10:58,137
She called me at midnight.

162
00:10:58,403 --> 00:10:59,503
She said she was getting married.

163
00:11:00,003 --> 00:11:01,437
So I asked her, "When?"

164
00:11:01,803 --> 00:11:03,110
She said, "Tomorrow morning."

165
00:11:03,110 --> 00:11:03,837
That crazy woman!

166
00:11:04,537 --> 00:11:05,670
I was so confused.

167
00:11:06,203 --> 00:11:07,003
Oh, God!

168
00:11:07,137 --> 00:11:07,703
Yeah.

169
00:11:07,703 --> 00:11:09,603
And she told me to get ready
to be her bridesmaid, too.

170
00:11:09,803 --> 00:11:12,137
I'd just finished a C-section
last night.

171
00:11:12,303 --> 00:11:13,203
How was I supposed to prepare?

172
00:11:14,137 --> 00:11:16,603
So this is what they call
a whirlwind wedding.

173
00:11:22,470 --> 00:11:25,870
Ma, once the photos are done,
can I go pick up my new car?

174
00:11:26,470 --> 00:11:27,582
Of course, sweetheart.

175
00:11:28,033 --> 00:11:31,237
As long as you do
everything I tell you.

176
00:11:32,037 --> 00:11:32,837
Okay.

177
00:11:33,937 --> 00:11:35,210
Then let's head to the venue.

178
00:11:35,561 --> 00:11:37,103
There are tons of reporters
waiting to interview us.

179
00:11:37,437 --> 00:11:39,403
Let's go, Pa and Ma

180
00:11:40,037 --> 00:11:44,337
Wait. You forgot
the groom's boutonnière.

181
00:11:44,703 --> 00:11:48,203
Sorry, what boutonnière?

182
00:11:48,670 --> 00:11:49,737
The groom's boutonnière.

183
00:11:50,270 --> 00:11:51,870
Huh? The groom?

184
00:11:54,070 --> 00:11:56,178
Now, calm down, sweetheart.

185
00:11:56,780 --> 00:11:59,637
Mrs. Chat wants to marry you.

186
00:11:59,637 --> 00:12:02,137
And I thought it would be
good for everyone.

187
00:12:03,237 --> 00:12:03,737
No!

188
00:12:03,737 --> 00:12:04,470
I won't do it!

189
00:12:05,537 --> 00:12:09,403
Yong, why are you
raising your voice at Ma?

190
00:12:10,403 --> 00:12:13,203
Ma, I can't marry Mrs. Chat.

191
00:12:14,503 --> 00:12:15,611
If you refuse to marry her,

192
00:12:16,213 --> 00:12:18,017
you can forget about the new car!

193
00:12:18,017 --> 00:12:20,500
I'll freeze all your
supplementary cards, too.

194
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:22,470
Let's see how you'll manage after that!

195
00:12:23,337 --> 00:12:25,670
Ma, I'm not ready.

196
00:12:26,603 --> 00:12:27,437
(sighs)

197
00:12:28,070 --> 00:12:28,870
I know.

198
00:12:30,003 --> 00:12:33,937
But everything has already
been arranged, Yong.

199
00:12:34,437 --> 00:12:37,337
Don't ruin the image
we've worked so hard to build.

200
00:12:38,537 --> 00:12:39,903
Just go through with the wedding.

201
00:12:40,737 --> 00:12:42,237
Everything will work out afterward.

202
00:12:42,703 --> 00:12:44,603
Trust me, Yong.

203
00:12:47,337 --> 00:12:48,137
Come along.

204
00:12:57,737 --> 00:12:58,537
Nant.

205
00:12:59,203 --> 00:13:00,437
She is the only one
who can help me now!

206
00:13:06,903 --> 00:13:07,703
Nant!

207
00:13:08,270 --> 00:13:09,103
Where are you?

208
00:13:11,037 --> 00:13:12,637
Come ruin my wedding right now.

209
00:13:13,670 --> 00:13:15,003
I’ll give you 100 grand.

210
00:13:22,070 --> 00:13:22,570
So beautiful.

211
00:13:22,570 --> 00:13:24,323
Absolutely gorgeous!

212
00:13:25,527 --> 00:13:27,106
Excuse me.

213
00:13:27,835 --> 00:13:29,835
The groom is here!

214
00:13:30,703 --> 00:13:32,403
Here comes our handsome groom.

215
00:13:33,003 --> 00:13:33,803
Wow.

216
00:13:33,903 --> 00:13:34,703
They're such a perfect match.

217
00:13:35,103 --> 00:13:36,070
The groom is so handsome.

218
00:13:36,337 --> 00:13:37,137
The bride is so beautiful.

219
00:13:37,303 --> 00:13:38,837
Let's get a photo of the happy couple.

220
00:13:39,503 --> 00:13:40,737
Look at the groom's face.

221
00:13:41,137 --> 00:13:42,670
He looks like such
a delicate little rich boy.

222
00:13:43,070 --> 00:13:44,937
What the hell is Chat planning?

223
00:13:45,870 --> 00:13:46,670
Right.

224
00:13:49,137 --> 00:13:50,337
Hello, Young Master.

225
00:13:50,870 --> 00:13:52,037
It's a pleasure to meet you.

226
00:13:53,870 --> 00:13:55,037
The pleasure is mine.

227
00:14:07,137 --> 00:14:09,503
Are you looking for someone?

228
00:14:10,403 --> 00:14:11,537
N-No.

229
00:14:29,737 --> 00:14:30,755
Too rich for my blood.

230
00:14:32,059 --> 00:14:34,349
I’ve been hired to break up
so many couples already.

231
00:14:35,252 --> 00:14:36,279
Who would've thought?

232
00:14:36,781 --> 00:14:38,863
Today, it's actually my best friend.

233
00:14:39,816 --> 00:14:42,372
Your best friend is here, Yong.

234
00:14:42,723 --> 00:14:43,503
Where are you going?

235
00:14:44,870 --> 00:14:47,670
Only VIP guests with invitations
are allowed into this wedding.

236
00:14:55,837 --> 00:14:58,800
Oh, I'm not here for the wedding.

237
00:14:59,302 --> 00:15:02,319
Yong ordered something from me,

238
00:15:02,319 --> 00:15:04,503
so I need to deliver it
to him personally.

239
00:15:05,403 --> 00:15:06,138
What is it?

240
00:15:07,442 --> 00:15:09,470
You can leave it at
the registration desk.

241
00:15:14,803 --> 00:15:17,850
I can't leave it there.

242
00:15:18,552 --> 00:15:20,837
It's a secret between Mr. Yong and me.

243
00:15:21,937 --> 00:15:23,313
Then please go home.

244
00:15:24,316 --> 00:15:25,203
This way, please.

245
00:15:30,303 --> 00:15:31,113
You!

246
00:15:32,066 --> 00:15:33,313
Do you know

247
00:15:34,166 --> 00:15:35,501
what Mr. Yong has to do tonight?

248
00:15:36,354 --> 00:15:38,074
He's got to consummate the marriage.

249
00:15:39,529 --> 00:15:43,870
And what exactly is he supposed to do?

250
00:15:51,103 --> 00:15:53,576
Oh, come on!

251
00:15:54,228 --> 00:16:00,618
This is something to help him get it up.

252
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:03,139
It's important.

253
00:16:05,403 --> 00:16:06,203
Err...

254
00:16:06,537 --> 00:16:08,603
As a fellow man,
you'd understand, right?

255
00:16:09,670 --> 00:16:11,803
If he can't perform tonight,

256
00:16:12,403 --> 00:16:14,503
I'm as good as dead!

257
00:16:16,103 --> 00:16:16,903
Damn,

258
00:16:17,137 --> 00:16:18,403
What should I do?

259
00:16:18,937 --> 00:16:20,403
If he gets worked up...

260
00:16:20,903 --> 00:16:22,703
I won't get fired, will I?

261
00:16:25,417 --> 00:16:26,815
Damn!

262
00:16:27,249 --> 00:16:29,249
You're one of our people.

263
00:16:29,318 --> 00:16:32,020
I'm just going in to deliver something.

264
00:16:32,283 --> 00:16:33,631
That's all. Nothing more.

265
00:16:33,631 --> 00:16:35,611
You'll be doing the boss a good deed.

266
00:16:36,325 --> 00:16:37,071
Oh.

267
00:16:37,071 --> 00:16:38,118
You're one of our people, right?

268
00:16:38,524 --> 00:16:39,420
That's right.

269
00:16:40,255 --> 00:16:41,151
Here's the deal.

270
00:16:41,402 --> 00:16:42,499
Be quick about it.

271
00:16:42,779 --> 00:16:43,575
And most importantly...

272
00:16:43,575 --> 00:16:45,424
Don't get me into trouble, understand?

273
00:16:45,936 --> 00:16:46,933
If I get fired, I'm dead!

274
00:16:47,135 --> 00:16:48,282
Okay.

275
00:16:48,533 --> 00:16:50,717
Thanks a lot.

276
00:16:52,004 --> 00:16:53,137
I...

277
00:16:53,137 --> 00:16:54,590
wish you...

278
00:16:55,342 --> 00:16:59,005
win the first-prize lottery!

279
00:17:00,791 --> 00:17:01,788
What a sweetheart!

280
00:17:01,788 --> 00:17:03,136
Go go.

281
00:17:14,203 --> 00:17:16,489
I have to thank the papaya salad lady

282
00:17:16,489 --> 00:17:18,537
for cursing out her husband
in Isan every day.

283
00:17:24,070 --> 00:17:25,670
What performance-enhancing drug?

284
00:17:29,303 --> 00:17:31,403
It's actually a tear-inducing spray.

285
00:17:38,303 --> 00:17:39,685
Ow, ow!

286
00:17:41,441 --> 00:17:42,447
That stings.

287
00:17:42,447 --> 00:17:43,635
Ow.

288
00:17:44,137 --> 00:17:44,751
Ow.

289
00:17:45,905 --> 00:17:47,273
Ow.

290
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:52,258
In five minutes,

291
00:17:52,258 --> 00:17:54,521
The ceremony will begin

292
00:17:54,772 --> 00:17:56,888
Please cooperate for
just a little longer.

293
00:18:01,508 --> 00:18:02,404
You look gorgeous.

294
00:18:02,404 --> 00:18:03,652
You look perfect together.
A match made in heaven.

295
00:18:05,737 --> 00:18:06,889
There are cameras everywhere.

296
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:08,621
Give us a smile, please.

297
00:18:09,137 --> 00:18:09,983
Smile!

298
00:18:10,214 --> 00:18:11,411
Come on, smile!

299
00:18:14,359 --> 00:18:15,305
We've already interviewed the bride,
right?

300
00:18:15,305 --> 00:18:15,805
Yes.

301
00:18:15,805 --> 00:18:18,252
Let's interview the groom
now, shall we, Mr. Yong?

302
00:18:18,252 --> 00:18:18,847
Okay?

303
00:18:18,847 --> 00:18:22,101
So, Mr. Yong, how are
you feeling right now?

304
00:18:22,402 --> 00:18:22,947
Oh...

305
00:18:23,361 --> 00:18:25,361
Well, today,
I wasn't going to get marr

306
00:18:25,795 --> 00:18:27,135
I mean, get marri—

307
00:18:27,637 --> 00:18:28,670
He's nervous.

308
00:18:30,837 --> 00:18:33,317
The groom is a little shy.

309
00:18:33,317 --> 00:18:34,270
He's might...

310
00:18:35,037 --> 00:18:39,837
stumble over his words a bit...
But he's just nervous.

311
00:18:40,137 --> 00:18:43,303
Oh, that's understandable.

312
00:18:43,870 --> 00:18:46,012
After all, he's a brand-new groom.

313
00:18:46,012 --> 00:18:48,887
And this is such a whirlwind wedding!

314
00:18:48,887 --> 00:18:51,645
Everyone's dying to know...

315
00:18:51,645 --> 00:18:55,010
Why are you getting
married in such a hurry?

316
00:18:55,010 --> 00:18:57,303
Or is there some good news on the way?

317
00:18:57,603 --> 00:18:59,238
Oh, no, it's just...

318
00:18:59,238 --> 00:19:00,794
The truth is, I just...

319
00:19:00,794 --> 00:19:01,294
I just...

320
00:19:01,637 --> 00:19:02,137
Just...

321
00:19:02,137 --> 00:19:02,637
Yes?

322
00:19:03,670 --> 00:19:05,703
About to launch a new project!

323
00:19:06,070 --> 00:19:06,903
Whoa!

324
00:19:08,537 --> 00:19:11,829
How big is this new project?
Our viewers are curious!

325
00:19:11,829 --> 00:19:14,503
Why throw such a huge,
extravagant party?

326
00:19:14,903 --> 00:19:15,552
That's right.

327
00:19:15,552 --> 00:19:17,103
It's definitely a big project.

328
00:19:18,037 --> 00:19:19,133
A massive one.

329
00:19:19,133 --> 00:19:20,703
Bigger than anyone expects.

330
00:19:21,303 --> 00:19:23,703
But for now, we'll
have to keep it a secret.

331
00:19:24,203 --> 00:19:25,774
We're saving it as a surprise.

332
00:19:25,774 --> 00:19:26,274
Ooh!

333
00:19:26,470 --> 00:19:27,437
A secret.

334
00:19:27,870 --> 00:19:28,270
A secret.

335
00:19:28,270 --> 00:19:30,437
It's top secret until the big reveal.

336
00:19:31,070 --> 00:19:31,870
Or could it be...

337
00:19:39,079 --> 00:19:40,528
Honey!

338
00:19:40,528 --> 00:19:41,976
Whoa!

339
00:19:44,262 --> 00:19:45,610
Wait a minute.

340
00:19:49,529 --> 00:19:51,529
Hey! Hey!

341
00:19:53,503 --> 00:19:55,470
Yong is going to have a baby!

342
00:19:55,471 --> 00:19:57,270
What?!

343
00:19:57,472 --> 00:19:57,972
A baby?

344
00:19:57,972 --> 00:19:59,037
Whose baby?

345
00:19:59,803 --> 00:20:00,603
Holy shit!

346
00:20:06,237 --> 00:20:07,903
This is Yong's baby!

347
00:20:08,103 --> 00:20:09,070
And as for Yong...

348
00:20:09,737 --> 00:20:12,603
Yong is my husband!

349
00:20:21,949 --> 00:20:23,337
What the hell is going on?

350
00:20:25,303 --> 00:20:26,403
Looks like you're in trouble now, girl.

351
00:20:28,937 --> 00:20:30,270
You're not getting out of this alive.

352
00:20:32,870 --> 00:20:33,803
Yong.

353
00:20:35,070 --> 00:20:35,870
Honey!

354
00:20:36,537 --> 00:20:38,603
You're abandoning
your heavily pregnant wife...

355
00:20:39,537 --> 00:20:42,237
To marry this old lady instead?

356
00:20:45,803 --> 00:20:47,303
Yong, look at me.

357
00:20:48,003 --> 00:20:48,803
I'm...

358
00:20:48,803 --> 00:20:49,703
I'm still young.

359
00:20:49,837 --> 00:20:50,903
I'm still beautiful.

360
00:20:54,552 --> 00:20:55,870
Hey!

361
00:20:55,870 --> 00:20:58,203
But this old lady is beautiful, too.

362
00:20:59,137 --> 00:20:59,937
It's just...

363
00:21:01,003 --> 00:21:02,837
She's beautiful in a more mature way.

364
00:21:08,903 --> 00:21:09,703
That’s brutal.

365
00:21:11,203 --> 00:21:13,103
Mrs. Chat,
aren't you going to say anything?

366
00:21:14,137 --> 00:21:16,807
Everyone, take a good look at this!

367
00:21:16,807 --> 00:21:19,093
This woman stole my husband!

368
00:21:19,093 --> 00:21:21,070
She stole my baby’s daddy!

369
00:21:23,899 --> 00:21:25,899
Mrs. Chat, what the hell is going on?

370
00:21:26,284 --> 00:21:27,632
Wait!

371
00:21:29,103 --> 00:21:30,337
Who stole your husband?

372
00:21:32,003 --> 00:21:34,303
And stop calling me an old lady!

373
00:21:38,537 --> 00:21:39,788
Ouch!

374
00:21:40,537 --> 00:21:41,337
My stomach hurts!

375
00:21:41,837 --> 00:21:42,837
When you talk to me like that...

376
00:21:43,203 --> 00:21:44,470
You stress me out.

377
00:21:44,837 --> 00:21:45,903
Whoa!

378
00:21:46,637 --> 00:21:49,003
I feel so sorry for little Tiger!

379
00:21:49,637 --> 00:21:51,340
Whoa!

380
00:21:51,637 --> 00:21:52,437
Help me!

381
00:21:52,503 --> 00:21:53,303
Little Tiger!

382
00:21:53,303 --> 00:21:54,103
Yong!

383
00:21:54,437 --> 00:21:56,503
Yong, please help your wife and baby!

384
00:21:56,941 --> 00:21:58,941
Stop!

385
00:22:06,637 --> 00:22:07,577
Boss.

386
00:22:07,928 --> 00:22:08,738
Now,

387
00:22:09,340 --> 00:22:11,516
The Singaporean investors...

388
00:22:11,516 --> 00:22:13,337
They've decided to put
their investment on hold.

389
00:22:15,737 --> 00:22:20,129
So she really is his lawful wife,
and that's really his child?

390
00:22:21,020 --> 00:22:21,847
But that's not what's happening!

391
00:22:21,847 --> 00:22:22,493
Exactly.

392
00:22:24,260 --> 00:22:25,262
What's going on?

393
00:22:25,262 --> 00:22:26,115
She announced it
in the middle of the wedding!

394
00:22:26,115 --> 00:22:28,115
Ruining the wedding is one thing...

395
00:22:30,037 --> 00:22:32,106
But ruining a hundred-million deal?

396
00:22:32,107 --> 00:22:34,107
That's too much!

397
00:22:36,161 --> 00:22:36,907
Whoa!

398
00:22:39,034 --> 00:22:39,930
Chom!

399
00:22:40,833 --> 00:22:41,981
Take care of the guests.

400
00:22:41,981 --> 00:22:43,168
Okay.

401
00:22:43,722 --> 00:22:45,722
What's gonna happen next?
We're live right now.

402
00:22:48,335 --> 00:22:49,252
End the live!

403
00:22:49,837 --> 00:22:52,070
But we have millions of viewers.

404
00:22:52,137 --> 00:22:54,337
The comments are going absolutely wild.

405
00:22:54,470 --> 00:22:55,270
If you don't stop it...

406
00:22:56,103 --> 00:22:58,229
Should I have a court order

407
00:22:58,229 --> 00:23:00,003
delivered to your office
tomorrow to shut it down?

408
00:23:00,237 --> 00:23:01,747
We'll end it now. Close the camera.

409
00:23:01,747 --> 00:23:02,951
Do it now! Everyone stop!

410
00:23:02,951 --> 00:23:03,451
It's done! We stopped the live.

411
00:23:03,537 --> 00:23:04,437
Secretary Han!

412
00:23:06,003 --> 00:23:07,003
Get the media out.

413
00:23:07,137 --> 00:23:07,937
Yes, Boss.

414
00:23:08,003 --> 00:23:09,070
I'll take care of it.

415
00:23:09,303 --> 00:23:10,237
Everyone, please...

416
00:23:10,670 --> 00:23:11,670
This way, please.

417
00:23:12,037 --> 00:23:12,837
Please come with me.

418
00:23:12,870 --> 00:23:14,103
No interviews for now.

419
00:23:14,337 --> 00:23:15,403
Boss isn't available.

420
00:23:15,503 --> 00:23:16,303
This way, please.

421
00:23:16,670 --> 00:23:17,470
Please come along.

422
00:23:17,503 --> 00:23:18,437
Right this way.

423
00:23:37,637 --> 00:23:38,937
Why didn't you run away?

424
00:23:40,270 --> 00:23:42,403
I felt sorry for the security guard.

425
00:23:44,137 --> 00:23:45,470
Worry about yourself first!

426
00:23:54,503 --> 00:23:56,003
Are you two done whispering?

427
00:24:05,803 --> 00:24:09,737
Yong, do you still love
me and our baby?

428
00:24:10,237 --> 00:24:11,037
I love you.

429
00:24:15,103 --> 00:24:15,903
Love me?

430
00:24:16,470 --> 00:24:18,937
If you love me,
why are you marrying this old lady?

431
00:24:21,003 --> 00:24:22,537
Ma forced me!

432
00:24:22,837 --> 00:24:24,637
I told her I didn't want
an arranged marriage!

433
00:24:24,870 --> 00:24:26,937
I don't care about
this merger or any of it!

434
00:24:28,503 --> 00:24:30,055
Oh, I see...

435
00:24:31,837 --> 00:24:33,803
So your mom and
this old lady forced you?

436
00:24:35,603 --> 00:24:38,137
Wait a minute. Who forced whom?

437
00:24:42,670 --> 00:24:43,239
Yong!

438
00:24:44,292 --> 00:24:46,337
Both our families agreed to this!

439
00:24:47,037 --> 00:24:48,603
I didn't even know about it, Ma.

440
00:24:49,203 --> 00:24:50,003
Jeez.

441
00:24:50,470 --> 00:24:51,475
We'll deal with
the adults' business later.

442
00:24:51,977 --> 00:24:53,772
Right now,
you have some explanation to give.

443
00:24:53,772 --> 00:24:55,602
Who is this girl?

444
00:24:55,853 --> 00:24:56,905
Is she your wife?

445
00:25:00,537 --> 00:25:01,337
Yes!

446
00:25:03,237 --> 00:25:06,003
I'm his wife!
I was his wife before this old lady!

447
00:25:17,037 --> 00:25:18,550
I can't take this anymore!

448
00:25:18,901 --> 00:25:20,054
I'm counting on you.

449
00:25:20,665 --> 00:25:21,511
Yong!

450
00:25:21,511 --> 00:25:22,658
Yong, come back here!

451
00:25:22,658 --> 00:25:23,655
Yong!

452
00:25:24,389 --> 00:25:25,486
Wait, Yong.

453
00:25:25,486 --> 00:25:26,537
Yong.

454
00:25:26,966 --> 00:25:28,314
He just left me here.

455
00:25:28,848 --> 00:25:30,296
What do I do now?

456
00:25:30,598 --> 00:25:31,645
Yong, you bastard.

457
00:25:32,179 --> 00:25:33,376
He really ran away?

458
00:25:34,437 --> 00:25:35,670
He just abandoned me.

459
00:25:36,470 --> 00:25:37,270
What am I supposed to do now?

460
00:25:38,037 --> 00:25:38,837
What do I do?

461
00:25:43,203 --> 00:25:45,737
My hundred-million-baht deal
is ruined because of you!

462
00:25:59,103 --> 00:26:06,303
I didn't mean to make things this big.

463
00:26:07,837 --> 00:26:09,322
Erm...

464
00:26:11,337 --> 00:26:15,871
I've decided to give up.

465
00:26:17,075 --> 00:26:17,744
I will...

466
00:26:19,048 --> 00:26:21,541
I'll get out of your way.

467
00:26:21,541 --> 00:26:24,871
Bye.

468
00:26:26,777 --> 00:26:28,087
It's too late for that.

469
00:26:35,470 --> 00:26:36,470
Secretary Han.

470
00:26:36,903 --> 00:26:38,303
Go bring Yong back.

471
00:26:38,837 --> 00:26:39,837
Understood, Boss.

472
00:26:46,703 --> 00:26:48,335
You caused all this trouble...

473
00:26:49,188 --> 00:26:51,237
And now you think
you can just walk away?

474
00:26:51,537 --> 00:26:53,760
Oh, no! I'm not running away.

475
00:26:54,512 --> 00:26:57,759
I didn't mean to run away.

476
00:26:58,210 --> 00:27:01,102
As I said...

477
00:27:01,102 --> 00:27:03,193
I've already given up.

478
00:27:03,444 --> 00:27:04,605
I...

479
00:27:05,870 --> 00:27:09,191
I'll let you have Yong.

480
00:27:09,191 --> 00:27:12,791
You can have him! I'm done.

481
00:27:18,208 --> 00:27:19,260
You'll let me have him?

482
00:27:19,511 --> 00:27:20,638
Now?

483
00:27:21,140 --> 00:27:22,289
After you made such a scene...

484
00:27:22,590 --> 00:27:24,653
And completely ruined my wedding?!

485
00:27:26,203 --> 00:27:30,790
Oh, right. That's true.

486
00:27:31,392 --> 00:27:33,272
I'm so sorry.

487
00:27:34,537 --> 00:27:36,270
I accept apologies in cash.

488
00:27:37,703 --> 00:27:39,463
Oh, speaking of money...

489
00:27:40,717 --> 00:27:42,218
I don't have any.

490
00:27:42,920 --> 00:27:44,137
I really don't have any money.

491
00:27:47,437 --> 00:27:48,015
No money?

492
00:27:49,470 --> 00:27:50,640
No money?

493
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:53,333
No money at all?

494
00:27:54,286 --> 00:27:56,281
You had the nerve to act so bold
without any money to your name.

495
00:27:58,538 --> 00:27:59,066
Fine.

496
00:28:00,420 --> 00:28:03,202
Then get ready to receive
a court summons!

497
00:28:11,703 --> 00:28:13,362
Ow! That hurts!

498
00:28:13,813 --> 00:28:14,592
Let me go!

499
00:28:14,592 --> 00:28:15,092
Let me go!

500
00:28:15,092 --> 00:28:15,837
I'm not letting go!

501
00:28:23,537 --> 00:28:25,870
Hello? What did you say?

502
00:28:30,403 --> 00:28:34,103
Tell the media to stop reporting
this immediately!

503
00:28:36,537 --> 00:28:39,562
Ow!

504
00:28:39,562 --> 00:28:42,394
Ouch, my stomach!

505
00:28:42,394 --> 00:28:44,419
The baby is coming!

506
00:28:44,419 --> 00:28:46,295
My water just broke!

507
00:28:46,295 --> 00:28:47,611
My stomach hurts!

508
00:28:48,965 --> 00:28:50,738
Calm down! Take it easy!

509
00:28:53,237 --> 00:28:56,365
Hello, Secretary Han?
Call an ambulance!

510
00:28:56,365 --> 00:28:58,445
This girl is going into labor!

511
00:28:58,947 --> 00:29:00,809
Come sit down first.

512
00:29:00,809 --> 00:29:01,520
Easy...

513
00:29:01,520 --> 00:29:02,414
Easy...

514
00:29:05,023 --> 00:29:09,471
Easy, Secretary Han, call an ambulance!

515
00:29:11,860 --> 00:29:13,603
My stomach hurts!

516
00:29:13,603 --> 00:29:14,740
What do we do? Stay calm!

517
00:29:17,700 --> 00:29:18,444
Stay calm. It's okay.

518
00:29:18,444 --> 00:29:19,748
Easy, easy.

519
00:29:20,450 --> 00:29:22,400
(Chat) Take a breath first.
(Nant) My stomach hurts!

520
00:29:22,400 --> 00:29:23,919
Breathe. Breathe.

521
00:29:27,171 --> 00:29:29,171
Breath.

522
00:29:29,903 --> 00:29:30,681
That's it.

523
00:29:31,183 --> 00:29:35,597
Breathe in.

524
00:29:35,598 --> 00:29:39,454
Breathe out.

525
00:29:39,454 --> 00:29:43,310
Like a flower blooming.

526
00:29:43,544 --> 00:29:46,748
Like a vast mountain range.

527
00:29:47,050 --> 00:30:00,186
Like cool, flowing water.

528
00:30:03,870 --> 00:30:05,203
My voice is still as perfect as ever.

529
00:30:30,870 --> 00:30:32,137
Go bring her back.

530
00:30:33,137 --> 00:30:33,937
Right now!

531
00:30:34,870 --> 00:30:35,603
Go!

532
00:30:35,603 --> 00:30:37,237
Understood, Boss.

533
00:30:49,470 --> 00:30:50,337
Chat...

534
00:30:50,837 --> 00:30:53,470
I had no idea things
would turn out like this.

535
00:30:53,937 --> 00:30:55,537
I'll hold a press conference myself.

536
00:30:56,003 --> 00:30:58,103
I'll make sure
your reputation isn't damaged.

537
00:31:00,437 --> 00:31:01,237
Enough.

538
00:31:02,937 --> 00:31:04,137
My reputation...

539
00:31:05,903 --> 00:31:09,837
Was ruined the moment that
girl called me an old lady...

540
00:31:10,837 --> 00:31:12,470
In front of everyone at the wedding.

541
00:31:16,470 --> 00:31:17,737
As for the press conference...

542
00:31:18,903 --> 00:31:21,437
Please do whatever you want,
Auntie Lin.

543
00:31:22,603 --> 00:31:24,237
But about the merger deal.

544
00:31:25,237 --> 00:31:26,403
I'm canceling it.

545
00:31:26,937 --> 00:31:29,503
And I'm withdrawing all my investments.

546
00:31:30,870 --> 00:31:32,237
Wait, Chat!

547
00:31:33,803 --> 00:31:35,270
Mom, Chom, please go get some rest.

548
00:31:36,237 --> 00:31:37,270
I want to be alone.

549
00:31:38,503 --> 00:31:41,003
How can I leave you here alone, Chat?

550
00:31:41,337 --> 00:31:42,603
I'm worried about you.

551
00:31:44,103 --> 00:31:45,139
But right now...

552
00:31:45,540 --> 00:31:46,914
The person we should be
more worried about...

553
00:31:47,616 --> 00:31:48,937
Is Auntie Lin, Chom.

554
00:31:49,303 --> 00:31:50,862
Ma'am! Ma'am!

555
00:31:50,862 --> 00:31:54,534
Please calm down. Take it easy.

556
00:31:54,534 --> 00:31:55,034
Calm down.

557
00:31:55,034 --> 00:31:55,534
Breathe.

558
00:31:55,534 --> 00:31:56,395
Breathe.

559
00:31:56,395 --> 00:31:57,403
Chom.

560
00:31:57,403 --> 00:31:58,028
Yes?

561
00:31:58,028 --> 00:31:59,514
Go get Hanna for me.

562
00:31:59,765 --> 00:32:00,466
And...

563
00:32:01,003 --> 00:32:02,537
Should I go get Hanna first...

564
00:32:02,703 --> 00:32:04,603
Or call an ambulance first?

565
00:32:04,903 --> 00:32:05,870
Call the ambulance first, dear.

566
00:32:06,470 --> 00:32:07,403
Okay!

567
00:32:07,537 --> 00:32:08,070
Hurry, dear!

568
00:32:08,070 --> 00:32:08,870
Please wait a moment.

569
00:32:10,503 --> 00:32:11,270
Stay calm. It's okay.

570
00:32:11,270 --> 00:32:11,819
Breathe.

571
00:32:11,819 --> 00:32:12,437
Hello?

572
00:32:48,970 --> 00:32:50,000
[Pure drama mid-wedding!
#CEOHusbandSnatcher]

573
00:32:50,245 --> 00:32:56,093
[People on X is losing their mind over
what happened at that wedding!]

574
00:33:06,537 --> 00:33:07,837
Give me the full damage report.

575
00:33:08,837 --> 00:33:09,337
Okay.

576
00:33:10,942 --> 00:33:13,821
The Singaporean investors
have canceled their investment, Boss.

577
00:33:14,724 --> 00:33:18,742
Some board members are preparing to
vote you out as CEO.

578
00:33:19,545 --> 00:33:23,670
They say your public image is
affecting investor confidence.

579
00:33:29,903 --> 00:33:31,003
What about X trends?

580
00:33:32,403 --> 00:33:32,918
The hashtag...

581
00:33:33,721 --> 00:33:36,637
#CEOHusbandSnatcher
is trending at number one.

582
00:33:47,270 --> 00:33:48,237
Secretary Han.

583
00:33:49,437 --> 00:33:51,203
Investigate that girl's background.

584
00:33:51,637 --> 00:33:54,003
If she's chosen to
destroy my reputation...

585
00:33:55,137 --> 00:33:57,037
She will pay for it
to the fullest extent.

586
00:33:57,703 --> 00:33:58,737
Understood, Boss.

587
00:34:00,137 --> 00:34:00,937
Okay.

588
00:34:03,070 --> 00:34:04,070
I want it by tomorrow.

589
00:34:04,737 --> 00:34:05,537
Understood, Boss.

590
00:34:19,137 --> 00:34:20,903
All those keyboard warriors...

591
00:34:23,537 --> 00:34:24,803
Even with her face blurred...

592
00:34:26,437 --> 00:34:28,237
I'll never forget her face.

593
00:34:44,070 --> 00:34:44,870
Nant.

594
00:34:46,837 --> 00:34:48,437
Hong, you bastard.

595
00:34:48,637 --> 00:34:49,637
You just abandoned me!

596
00:34:50,137 --> 00:34:50,937
I'm sorry.

597
00:34:51,270 --> 00:34:53,203
If I'd stayed any longer,
we'd both be dead!

598
00:34:53,437 --> 00:34:54,670
That woman is terrifying.

599
00:34:58,937 --> 00:35:00,937
Here, I'll transfer you the money.

600
00:35:07,237 --> 00:35:08,031
And look at you!

601
00:35:08,633 --> 00:35:10,089
If you're going to pretend to be my wife...

602
00:35:10,390 --> 00:35:12,553
Couldn't you dress
a little more high-end?

603
00:35:13,870 --> 00:35:15,137
You know that's all I can afford.

604
00:35:15,470 --> 00:35:18,618
Fine, fine.
Use the money to pay off your debts.

605
00:35:18,618 --> 00:35:20,470
And keep your head down for a while.

606
00:35:20,903 --> 00:35:22,137
Yeah, I know!

607
00:35:23,203 --> 00:35:24,837
Thanks so much, my dear friend.

608
00:35:26,470 --> 00:35:28,113
Come here. Give me a kiss.

609
00:35:28,113 --> 00:35:28,737
Eww!

610
00:35:29,503 --> 00:35:30,303
Gross!

611
00:35:30,437 --> 00:35:32,637
I've had enough horror for one day.

612
00:35:34,937 --> 00:35:36,737
Now, I'll go face
the consequences with Ma.

613
00:35:37,437 --> 00:35:38,144
Bye.

614
00:35:48,603 --> 00:35:49,403
See you.

615
00:36:37,203 --> 00:36:39,048
Tuition fees... Rent...

616
00:36:39,349 --> 00:36:41,499
Paying off debts...

617
00:36:41,750 --> 00:36:43,903
And I'll still have
enough left for shabu.

618
00:36:55,437 --> 00:36:56,837
Have you forgotten
about me, sweetheart?

619
00:36:59,703 --> 00:37:00,503
Hello.

620
00:37:02,070 --> 00:37:05,203
I... I was planning to pay you today.

621
00:37:07,270 --> 00:37:09,203
But could I just pay
the interest for now?

622
00:37:09,537 --> 00:37:10,337
Just the interest?

623
00:37:10,703 --> 00:37:12,029
Hey!

624
00:37:13,932 --> 00:37:14,666
Hey!

625
00:37:14,961 --> 00:37:15,619
Let me see!

626
00:37:15,619 --> 00:37:16,670
Give it back!

627
00:37:16,803 --> 00:37:17,870
Hey, no need to rush.

628
00:37:20,803 --> 00:37:21,603
Damn!

629
00:37:23,637 --> 00:37:24,437
She has got 100 grand...

630
00:37:24,903 --> 00:37:26,877
Yet you lied and
said you'd only pay the interest?!

631
00:37:26,877 --> 00:37:27,703
Huh?

632
00:37:28,137 --> 00:37:29,537
I really need that money!

633
00:37:30,037 --> 00:37:30,648
Give it back!

634
00:37:30,648 --> 00:37:31,303
Hey!

635
00:37:33,344 --> 00:37:36,197
I really need that money.

636
00:37:36,789 --> 00:37:38,187
Please give it back.

637
00:37:38,771 --> 00:37:39,667
Hand it over!

638
00:37:40,151 --> 00:37:41,298
Please, give it back!

639
00:37:42,585 --> 00:37:43,130
Come here.

640
00:37:43,130 --> 00:37:43,876
Get up!

641
00:37:44,166 --> 00:37:44,962
Get up!

642
00:37:50,270 --> 00:37:51,070
Face the camera!

643
00:37:52,437 --> 00:37:53,237
Hey!

644
00:37:53,337 --> 00:37:54,003
Face the camera!

645
00:37:54,003 --> 00:37:56,403
Pay up nicely, or do I need to mess up
that pretty face of yours?

646
00:37:57,070 --> 00:37:57,870
Look at the camera.

647
00:38:02,903 --> 00:38:03,837
That's more like it.

648
00:38:16,070 --> 00:38:17,838
Consider your debt fully paid.

649
00:38:19,042 --> 00:38:22,071
Come back to me
when you're broke again, girl.

650
00:38:42,437 --> 00:38:44,303
Crying won't get your money back.

651
00:38:57,637 --> 00:38:59,337
Guess Shabu will have to wait.

652
00:40:21,603 --> 00:40:22,670
It's just fake news...

653
00:40:23,837 --> 00:40:25,403
But people are ready to believe it.

654
00:40:31,703 --> 00:40:32,503
Hanna!

655
00:40:32,603 --> 00:40:34,737
Is our PR team
completely useless or what?

656
00:40:35,303 --> 00:40:37,103
How did they let
this get so out of hand?

657
00:40:37,403 --> 00:40:39,870
The team is coordinating
with all the news outlets right now.

658
00:40:40,037 --> 00:40:41,903
The clips have been posted
by so many accounts.

659
00:40:42,137 --> 00:40:46,047
And people love this kind of drama,
so the reposts keep skyrocketing, Boss.

660
00:40:48,303 --> 00:40:50,103
Should I just fire the whole team?

661
00:40:50,537 --> 00:40:51,470
Please don't, Boss.

662
00:40:52,237 --> 00:40:53,203
What about the original video?

663
00:40:53,803 --> 00:40:55,037
Have you found out who posted it?

664
00:40:55,470 --> 00:40:58,247
Not yet. It seems to have been spread
across multiple accounts.

665
00:40:58,247 --> 00:41:00,337
Tracing it back to the original source
is proving very difficult.

666
00:41:00,670 --> 00:41:01,912
Then start with the people sharing it.

667
00:41:01,912 --> 00:41:04,123
Anyone who shares edited images...

668
00:41:04,123 --> 00:41:07,337
Or spreads false information,
take screenshots for all the evidence.

669
00:41:07,637 --> 00:41:11,103
Understood. And what about
tomorrow's press conference?

670
00:41:12,303 --> 00:41:14,003
Let the Yong family handle it.

671
00:41:14,803 --> 00:41:16,203
I'm not saying anything for now.

672
00:41:16,937 --> 00:41:19,603
The more I say, the more I'll play into
the hands of whoever started this.

673
00:41:23,470 --> 00:41:24,637
What about that girl?

674
00:41:25,803 --> 00:41:27,303
Have you found out who she is?

675
00:41:28,070 --> 00:41:29,470
We're still investigating.

676
00:41:33,670 --> 00:41:36,903
I need her information
by seven tomorrow morning, Secretary.

677
00:41:37,954 --> 00:41:39,954
Understood, Boss Chat.

678
00:41:46,070 --> 00:41:49,937
In just one day, everything
I've built nearly fell apart.

679
00:41:52,403 --> 00:41:54,470
Who is she?

680
00:42:01,503 --> 00:42:03,013
Send notices to every page
that posted the clip.

681
00:42:03,013 --> 00:42:05,403
If they don't take it down,
send them court summonses.

682
00:42:10,737 --> 00:42:11,537
Hello?

683
00:42:13,003 --> 00:42:13,803
What?

684
00:42:14,603 --> 00:42:16,470
You couldn't identify
the taxi from its license plate?

685
00:42:17,337 --> 00:42:19,437
Here's what we'll do.
Check every surveillance camera.

686
00:42:20,137 --> 00:42:21,203
Do it now.

687
00:42:27,403 --> 00:42:29,670
Boss Chat needs that woman's
information by seven tomorrow morning.

688
00:42:29,870 --> 00:42:31,470
Otherwise,
the whole team is getting fired.

689
00:42:35,103 --> 00:42:36,603
Ugh, three percent battery!

690
00:42:42,003 --> 00:42:44,303
Is this a charging cable
or my lifeline?

691
00:42:44,603 --> 00:42:46,103
Why is everything such a mess?

692
00:42:58,470 --> 00:43:02,103
A hundred thousand gone
in three minutes.

693
00:43:10,503 --> 00:43:12,537
But a debt is a debt.
I have to pay it back, right?

694
00:43:14,803 --> 00:43:15,603
Damn it.

695
00:43:16,237 --> 00:43:17,337
I just paid it off a little too quickly.

696
00:43:42,137 --> 00:43:42,937
Whatever.

697
00:43:43,637 --> 00:43:44,737
Back to work!

698
00:43:45,670 --> 00:43:47,503
At least one debt is gone.

699
00:43:49,203 --> 00:43:50,803
I'll find a way to pay the tuition.

700
00:43:52,337 --> 00:43:53,870
And the rent, too.

701
00:43:56,037 --> 00:43:57,670
I'll find a way to pay for the land.

702
00:43:58,603 --> 00:44:01,303
I'll take fifty more fake-breakup gigs.

703
00:44:02,103 --> 00:44:03,470
And stay single for another ten years.

704
00:44:04,337 --> 00:44:05,141
Eventually, these damn debts will...

705
00:44:05,843 --> 00:44:07,152
Just disappear somehow.

706
00:44:12,137 --> 00:44:12,937
Just keep fighting!

707
00:45:24,270 --> 00:45:25,070
Hello?

708
00:45:26,337 --> 00:45:27,137
Mm-hmm.

709
00:45:28,537 --> 00:45:29,470
Uh, Ai...

710
00:45:30,337 --> 00:45:31,503
Is Jaokha there with you?

711
00:45:31,903 --> 00:45:33,703
Yeah, I'm about to call her over.

712
00:45:34,503 --> 00:45:36,070
Where are we meeting?

713
00:45:37,037 --> 00:45:38,003
Rush Bar.

714
00:45:38,437 --> 00:45:39,237
Huh?

715
00:45:40,037 --> 00:45:40,903
A new place?

716
00:45:42,237 --> 00:45:43,037
Sigh...

717
00:45:43,203 --> 00:45:45,670
I don't feel like going
somewhere crowded today.

718
00:45:46,403 --> 00:45:48,703
Don't worry.
This place is super private.

719
00:45:48,870 --> 00:45:50,403
Only customers
with reservations can get in.

720
00:45:50,703 --> 00:45:52,270
No one will see you, I promise.

721
00:45:53,337 --> 00:45:54,137
Okay.

722
00:45:55,070 --> 00:45:56,637
Then send me the location.

723
00:45:58,003 --> 00:45:58,837
Yeah, yeah.

724
00:45:59,803 --> 00:46:00,603
See you there.

725
00:46:17,703 --> 00:46:18,837
Hello, Mom.

726
00:46:20,637 --> 00:46:22,137
Where are you all dressed up to go?

727
00:46:25,037 --> 00:46:26,603
I'm going out for a drink.

728
00:46:27,470 --> 00:46:31,270
The news just broke today.
What if someone sees you, Mrs. Chat?

729
00:46:32,870 --> 00:46:35,272
Mom, I just got dumped at the altar.

730
00:46:35,272 --> 00:46:37,884
I'm not a fugitive running from the law.

731
00:46:37,884 --> 00:46:40,472
I just want to go out and
be happy for two or three hours.

732
00:46:40,472 --> 00:46:41,737
Can't I?

733
00:46:46,237 --> 00:46:48,437
I promise I won't cause
any more headlines.

734
00:46:49,703 --> 00:46:51,837
Hmm.
Don't come home too late, sweetheart.

735
00:46:52,870 --> 00:46:53,670
Okay, Mom.

736
00:47:49,603 --> 00:47:50,403
Nant...

737
00:47:51,537 --> 00:47:52,337
Is...

738
00:47:52,937 --> 00:47:54,103
Is that really you?

739
00:47:54,937 --> 00:47:55,437
Huh?

740
00:47:55,437 --> 00:47:55,937
Look.

741
00:47:56,003 --> 00:47:56,803
What?

742
00:47:57,270 --> 00:48:00,103
You're in the CEOHusbandSnatcher
clip, right?

743
00:48:07,270 --> 00:48:08,737
You're famous now!

744
00:48:11,003 --> 00:48:12,070
Famous for what?

745
00:48:12,903 --> 00:48:14,337
For something like this?

746
00:48:14,503 --> 00:48:15,303
No thanks.

747
00:48:17,237 --> 00:48:18,137
Yeah, fair enough.

748
00:48:19,637 --> 00:48:23,615
But you're this famous now,
and you're still coming to work?

749
00:48:23,615 --> 00:48:24,670
Aren't you scared?

750
00:48:27,137 --> 00:48:30,737
Of course I am.
But I'm more scared of having no money.

751
00:48:34,803 --> 00:48:36,503
What if you run into her again?

752
00:48:38,470 --> 00:48:41,203
I'll run! Why would I stick around and
let them catch me?

753
00:48:42,337 --> 00:48:44,870
But surely my life can't get
that unlucky, right?

754
00:48:45,937 --> 00:48:46,837
Whatever you say.

755
00:48:48,103 --> 00:48:50,503
I'll go serve VIP Table One first.

756
00:48:50,703 --> 00:48:53,103
Okay, go ahead.
I'll be serving tables soon, too.

757
00:49:40,003 --> 00:49:42,903
Hey, where's that petite girl
who was here earlier?

758
00:49:43,303 --> 00:49:44,637
Oh, we let her go.

759
00:49:44,637 --> 00:49:47,092
She was clumsy and
stepped on a guest's foot.

760
00:49:47,092 --> 00:49:49,403
The guest got hurt,
so we had to let her go.

761
00:49:50,337 --> 00:49:54,070
As I've told you before,
at Rush Bar, the customer is king.

762
00:49:55,437 --> 00:49:56,888
See? I told you.

763
00:49:56,888 --> 00:49:58,724
You can relax here.

764
00:49:59,376 --> 00:50:01,654
Why don't we move to
the seats in front of the stage?

765
00:50:01,955 --> 00:50:03,034
The view is amazing!

766
00:50:03,034 --> 00:50:03,603
Let's go.

767
00:50:04,337 --> 00:50:05,137
I'm not going.

768
00:50:06,870 --> 00:50:09,903
This spot is fine.
I don't want to run into anyone.

769
00:50:11,003 --> 00:50:13,355
Come on. Let's check out some girls.

770
00:50:13,756 --> 00:50:15,904
You'll forget all the chaos from today.

771
00:50:17,537 --> 00:50:20,103
The only thing that'll
make me forget today...

772
00:50:21,237 --> 00:50:23,203
Is pure alcohol.

773
00:50:28,237 --> 00:50:29,103
Why the rush to chug it down?

774
00:50:31,337 --> 00:50:32,303
Wait for us.

775
00:50:32,503 --> 00:50:33,503
Another drink, please.

776
00:50:34,403 --> 00:50:35,203
Coming right up.

777
00:50:38,003 --> 00:50:38,803
Love me?

778
00:50:39,337 --> 00:50:41,703
If you love me,
why are you marrying this old lady?

779
00:50:42,303 --> 00:50:43,470
Hey, look at this.

780
00:50:43,670 --> 00:50:44,237
What?

781
00:50:44,237 --> 00:50:47,270
Did you see Hi-So Theerachat's face
when that girl called her an old lady?

782
00:50:48,070 --> 00:50:49,873
She looked so damn humiliated.

783
00:50:50,939 --> 00:50:54,946
Gosh, these perfectionists
are honestly so trash!

784
00:50:57,063 --> 00:50:59,063
Such an old lady...

785
00:51:04,837 --> 00:51:08,537
Talking too much. Should I shove
a liquor bottle down her throat?

786
00:51:08,937 --> 00:51:11,874
Calm down.
You're already all over the news.

787
00:51:12,526 --> 00:51:13,787
Should we go confront them?

788
00:51:14,903 --> 00:51:18,503
No need. I want to hear what else
they have to say.

789
00:51:24,437 --> 00:51:26,837
Here are your drinks, ladies.

790
00:51:31,070 --> 00:51:31,870
No way.

791
00:51:33,403 --> 00:51:34,303
Honey!

792
00:51:35,837 --> 00:51:38,032
Would you like

793
00:51:38,433 --> 00:51:40,703
any snacks or mixers with your drinks?

794
00:51:42,470 --> 00:51:43,837
I don't want any mixers.

795
00:51:44,337 --> 00:51:45,137
What I want...

796
00:51:49,070 --> 00:51:52,103
Is for you to sit and drink with us.

797
00:52:04,680 --> 00:52:06,680
Cheers!

798
00:52:08,703 --> 00:52:09,503
Keep them coming, darling.

799
00:52:09,749 --> 00:52:10,896
Another round.

800
00:52:16,703 --> 00:52:18,067
Cheers!

801
00:52:26,037 --> 00:52:27,883
Whoa!

802
00:52:36,537 --> 00:52:38,365
Cheers!

803
00:52:49,503 --> 00:52:51,637
Smooth and sweet!

804
00:52:56,003 --> 00:52:56,803
Oh.

805
00:52:57,037 --> 00:53:00,803
What a shame.
I'd love to keep drinking with you...

806
00:53:02,603 --> 00:53:03,537
But that's okay.

807
00:53:04,803 --> 00:53:07,470
I'll just take this tip, then.

808
00:53:13,537 --> 00:53:15,406
Thank you for the money.

809
00:53:16,537 --> 00:53:18,668
Bye.

810
00:53:20,437 --> 00:53:21,237
Hey! What the hell?

811
00:53:21,337 --> 00:53:22,137
The pregnant girl.

812
00:53:22,337 --> 00:53:23,137
Thief!

813
00:53:23,237 --> 00:53:23,937
Hey!

814
00:53:23,937 --> 00:53:24,737
Wait, what?

815
00:53:25,137 --> 00:53:25,937
We've got her.

816
00:53:27,103 --> 00:53:27,903
Old lady!

817
00:53:33,037 --> 00:53:35,627
What? I didn't steal anything.

818
00:53:35,627 --> 00:53:38,456
This is the tip the customer gave me.

819
00:53:38,757 --> 00:53:40,138
A tip?

820
00:53:41,337 --> 00:53:43,846
Looks to me like you're stealing money
from a drunk customer.

821
00:53:43,847 --> 00:53:45,847
No No No No

822
00:53:45,847 --> 00:53:47,295
These are my tips.

823
00:53:47,296 --> 00:53:48,845
I'm not stealing.

824
00:53:49,783 --> 00:53:50,730
Um

825
00:53:50,731 --> 00:53:52,731
If you don't have anything more.

826
00:53:53,014 --> 00:53:55,014
I'll go.

827
00:53:55,507 --> 00:53:56,537
You're not going anywhere!

828
00:53:57,188 --> 00:53:59,188
You're not getting away this time.

829
00:54:00,637 --> 00:54:01,437
Well, well...

830
00:54:02,037 --> 00:54:03,237
Fancy meeting you again so soon.

831
00:54:03,803 --> 00:54:05,003
Who is it, Chat?

832
00:54:07,737 --> 00:54:08,603
Look closely.

833
00:54:11,070 --> 00:54:11,870
Doesn't she look familiar?

834
00:54:13,737 --> 00:54:14,537
Hmm.
Don't come home too late, sweetheart.

835
00:54:15,137 --> 00:54:16,537
Jao Kha, does she look familiar to you?

836
00:54:17,070 --> 00:54:17,870
This girl...

837
00:54:20,003 --> 00:54:23,070
Isn't she the pregnant woman
who ruined your wedding?

838
00:54:23,071 --> 00:54:24,620
No No No No

839
00:54:25,436 --> 00:54:27,737
We have never met
each other before, yeah

840
00:54:28,043 --> 00:54:30,043
I don't recognize your face.

841
00:54:30,416 --> 00:54:32,416
That is my sister

842
00:54:32,797 --> 00:54:35,650
She's my twin. She's pregnant!

843
00:54:36,364 --> 00:54:37,662
Your twin?

844
00:54:39,883 --> 00:54:41,131
Yeah!

845
00:54:42,861 --> 00:54:44,109
Real...

846
00:54:44,861 --> 00:54:46,088
Real twins.

847
00:54:47,891 --> 00:54:52,677
Identical twins who just happen to
have a mole above their left eye...

848
00:54:52,677 --> 00:54:53,950
In exactly the same spot.

849
00:54:54,025 --> 00:54:56,025
Oh really.

850
00:54:56,538 --> 00:54:58,538
Um... Becuase...

851
00:54:59,278 --> 00:55:00,275
Um

852
00:55:00,600 --> 00:55:03,403
The egg is big at the same time, you know...

853
00:55:03,404 --> 00:55:05,404
Pure science, yeah!

854
00:55:06,203 --> 00:55:08,537
I'm an obstetrician, and
I've never heard that theory before.

855
00:55:08,953 --> 00:55:10,953
Wow, I feel sorry for you.

856
00:55:17,070 --> 00:55:20,560
And your twin just happens to have
the same scratch on her wrist...

857
00:55:20,961 --> 00:55:23,538
And the same necklace, too?

858
00:55:23,903 --> 00:55:25,637
I thought so.

859
00:55:25,837 --> 00:55:27,473
Thought so. Thought so.

860
00:55:28,639 --> 00:55:31,893
The necklace? I bought it during a
buy-one-get-one-free sale, yeah!

861
00:55:32,203 --> 00:55:33,637
And the scratch...

862
00:55:35,203 --> 00:55:36,703
It's from my kitty cat.

863
00:55:37,203 --> 00:55:38,337
Meow, you know

864
00:55:39,270 --> 00:55:40,303
It's not me, okay?

865
00:55:40,937 --> 00:55:42,337
I need to go.

866
00:55:42,737 --> 00:55:44,637
I need to go. Bye-bye!

867
00:55:51,803 --> 00:55:53,351
And I suppose your twin...

868
00:55:53,351 --> 00:55:56,303
Also passed her baby-powder scent
on to you, huh?

869
00:56:20,642 --> 00:56:21,765
Scared?

870
00:56:22,252 --> 00:56:23,862
Remember this feeling.

871
00:56:23,862 --> 00:56:26,593
Because from now on, you'll pay me back

872
00:56:26,796 --> 00:56:28,309
until I'm satisfied.

873
00:56:30,603 --> 00:56:32,603
About the money.
I don't have it.

874
00:56:32,604 --> 00:56:35,237
But I have something you want
even more than money.

875
00:56:35,892 --> 00:56:37,064
What exactly do you want?

876
00:56:37,064 --> 00:56:38,188
You have to hire me.

877
00:56:38,188 --> 00:56:41,013
As your personal secretary intern.
For three months,

878
00:56:41,573 --> 00:56:43,573
At double the salary.
